# Audit Remediation Walkthrough

I have implemented all the recommendations from the [final_audit_report.md](file:///c:/Users/dgper/Proyectos/ZeroCode/final_audit_report.md) to ensure the project is release-ready.

## Changes Implemented

### 1. Build & Routing
- Fixed the broken lazy import for `MediaApp` in [src/app/router.tsx](file:///c:/Users/dgper/Proyectos/ZeroCode/src/app/router.tsx).
- Resolved type errors in [reformas/routes.tsx](file:///c:/Users/dgper/Proyectos/ZeroCode/src/features/projects/reformas/routes.tsx) by providing default loader data.

### 2. Type Safety & Hoisting
- Fixed function hoisting errors in [PriceAlerts.tsx](file:///c:/Users/dgper/Proyectos/ZeroCode/src/features/projects/crypto/components/PriceAlerts.tsx) and [ConfirmationStep.tsx](file:///c:/Users/dgper/Proyectos/ZeroCode/src/features/projects/salon/src/components/booking/steps/ConfirmationStep.tsx) by moving function declarations before their first use in `useEffect`.
- Added a guard clause to [MagneticButton.tsx](file:///c:/Users/dgper/Proyectos/ZeroCode/src/components/ui/MagneticButton.tsx) to handle cases where `ref.current` might be null, preventing runtime errors.
- Fixed missing `description` prop in [HomeTemplate.tsx](file:///c:/Users/dgper/Proyectos/ZeroCode/src/features/projects/reformas/src/templates/HomeTemplate.tsx) for SEO schema.

### 3. Tooling & Configuration
- Created a root [.eslintignore](file:///c:/Users/dgper/Proyectos/ZeroCode/.eslintignore) file to exclude `src/dataconnect-generated/**` and other build artifacts from linting.
- Updated [prisma.ts](file:///c:/Users/dgper/Proyectos/ZeroCode/src/features/projects/salon/src/lib/prisma.ts) to use `import.meta.env.MODE` instead of `process.env.NODE_ENV` to comply with the project's frontend environment.

